{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"CurrentValueSubject.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject.swift#L36"},"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"title":"CurrentValueSubject","symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject"}],"externalID":"s:7Afluent19CurrentValueSubjectC"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts its current value and all subsequent values to multiple consumers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can also handle completion events, including normal termination and failure with an error."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s CurrentValueSubject."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/Iterator"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/init()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/init(_:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/value"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/makeAsyncIterator()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/send()